  "description": "La Vida means street life and that's exactly what this bike is, built for the streets. Full Cr-Mo frame fork, bar and cranks. Sealed bike throughout with 28/9 gearing. Finished with double wall rims and Chad Kerley's signature tires. There's nothing this bike won't handle.\n100% crmo frame with integrated head tube, Mid BB shell, integrated seat clamp and removable brake and cable mounts - 20.5\" or 21\" top tube\n100% crmo fork with internal threaded steer tube and tapered legs\n100% crmo bars 8.75\" (on 20.5\") or 9\" (on 21\") with Premium top load stem\nPremium Team Grips\nThree-piece crmo 175mm 8-spline cranks with sealed Mid BB\n28/9 gearing with alloy sprocket\nFully sealed wheels with Samsara front and rear double-wall rims\nPremium CK tires 2.4\" front and rear\nPremium Fat Capitol seat with alloy Pivotal post\nPremium Kinetic plastic pedals",
